      { kind: "text", text: "Return to sport should not be based on time alone. Many athletes require around 9–12 months or longer before returning to pivoting sports. Clearance should consider strength symmetry, hop testing, movement quality, confidence, knee stability and sport-specific readiness." },
      { kind: "warning", text: "Returning too early increases the risk of graft failure or injury to the opposite knee." }
